  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "The `ccVSVSSE003_` records are in `ccvsvsse003-necroarts.esl`, and each `DS` twin has the same level.",
      "The Soul Cairn summons use the Soul Cairn wrappers as their template but not for `Stats`: `DLC1SoulCairnBonemanSummon` and `ccRMSSSE001_BonemanSummon` template `DLC1LvlSoulCairnBonemanMissile` 0071AA:Dawnguard.esm, `DLC1SoulCairnMistmanSummon` and `ccRMSSSE001_MistmanSummon` template `DLC1LvlSoulCairnMistman` 0071AF:Dawnguard.esm, `DLC1SoulCairnWrathmanSummon` and `ccRMSSSE001_WrathmanSummon` template `DLC1LvlSoulCairnWrathman` 0071AD:Dawnguard.esm (all on *Soul Cairn Undead*, where they take the draugr levels). The summons keep 6 · 13 · 30 whatever those lists do; the shout copies `DLC1EncUndeadSummon1–3` template the summons, also without `Stats`, and keep 6.",
      "The zombie summons use the placed zombies `ccBGSSSE003EncZombie01BodyA` 000D64 (Zombie, Malignant), `…BodyB` 000D69 (Foul) and `…BodyC` 000D6A (Putrid), all :ccbgssse003-zombies.esl and on *Zombies (CC)*, as their template but not for `Stats`: they keep 3 · 6 · 13 · 21.",
      "The other templated summons follow the placed creature through `Stats`: `DLC2SummonAshSpawn01` from `DLC2EncAshSpawn1H01` 01B636:Dragonborn.esm (on *Ash Spawn*), both Ash Guardians from `DLC2encAshGuardian` 01AAAF:Dragonborn.esm (on *Ash Guardian*), `ccBGSSSE067_ConjureEncAyleidLich` from `EncDragonPriest` 023A93 (on *Dragon Priests*), the Ancestor Ghosts from their draugr lists. The `ccVSVSSE003_` summons have no template.",
      "Untemplated records of the same races: `EncSkeleton01Melee1H` · `…Melee1Hshield` · `…Melee2H` · `…Missile` (level 1; on *Common Skeletons*), `DLC01SoulCairnReaper` 01A73E:Dawnguard.esm (on *Soul Cairn Undead*), `DLC2EncAshSpawn1H03` 01B63A:Dragonborn.esm (on *Ash Spawn*). `DLC1SoulCairnEncMistMen01Magic1` 019AB0, `DLC1SoulCairnEncSkeleton01Melee2H` 019AB1, `DLC1SoulCairnEncSkeletonNecro01Melee1H` 006AF0 and `…02` 006AF1 (all :Dawnguard.esm, level 1), `ccRMSSSE001_Skeleton01Summon` 000873:ccrmssse001-necrohouse.esl and `ccVSVSSE004_ChildSkeleton` 000858:ccvsvsse004-beafarmer.esl (level 1) are named only on the *Skeletons* group page; `ccBGSSSE031_Corpse` 000810:ccbgssse031-advcyrus.esm (level 1) is on *Solitude*.",
      "Every row: no other record keeps its own level."
    ]
  },
